  optional language-detection upgrade). Any saturn report whose language counts
  were produced by lid.176 is a derivative work for those figures and carries
  the same CC-BY-SA-3.0 license. Saturn stamps that attribution into the report
  footer and into an "attributions" key in the JSON findings sidecar whenever
